<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Email verification</title>
    {{ template "_styles" }}
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Hey there! 👋</h1>
      <p>
        Thanks for signing up! We're excited to have you on board. To finish
        setting up your account, just follow the link below to verify your
        email:
      </p>
      <p>
        <a href="{{ AuthCodeURL "verification" . }}" class="button">Verify email</a>
      </p>
      <p>If this wasn't you, no worries — just ignore this email.</p>
      <p>Cheers,<br />Cameron</p>
      <div class="footer">
        <p>Need help? Reach us at <a href="mailto:{{ SupportEmail }}">{{ SupportEmail }}</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
